\f0\fs24 \cf0 This repository contains code to for the MPX NYC Report website. \
\
The structure of the website is laid out in the _quarto.yml file.\
\
Folder 0 contains a quarto file to generate a single pdf of the entire contents of the site. Folders 1-7 contain code and text for the content of the report. \
\
Functions are defined in the R_functions folder and called from Folders 0-7. The repository uses the targets package to manage data cleaning and analysis (see _targets.R script).\
\
Resources like images and supplementary data are in the R_resources folder. \
